{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06781","headline":"途中作 · 王昌龄","name":"途中作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"游人愁岁晏，早起遵王畿。\n坠叶吹未晓，疎林月微微。\n惊禽栖不定，寒兽相因依。\n叹此霜露下，复闻鸿雁飞。\n渺然江南意，惜与中途违。\n羇旅悲壮发，别离念征衣。\n永图岂劳止，明节期所归。\n宁厌楚山曲，无人长掩扉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王昌龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06781.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06781","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}